{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07452","headline":"将赴岭外留题萧寺远公院 · 刘长卿","name":"将赴岭外留题萧寺远公院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹房遥闭上方幽，苔径苍苍访昔游。\n内史旧山空日暮，南朝古木向人秋。\n天香月色同僧室，叶落猨啼傍客舟。\n此去播迁明主意，白云何事欲相留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"郑临川"}